<title>USA: HemaCare Corp Q4 oper net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>HemaCare Corp Q4 oper net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996	  Q4	  1995</p>
<p> Shr oper profit	  $ nil     loss	 $0.02</p>
<p> Net oper profit		7     loss	   125</p>
<p> Revs			 2,807		    2,859</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,178		    5,905</p>
<p>					   YEAR</p>
<p> Shr oper loss	    $0.17   profit	 $0.08</p>
<p> Net oper loss	    1,090   profit	   480</p>
<p> Revs			10,921		   10,783</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	 6,350		    5,844</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Shr and net figures are from continuing operations.</p>
<p>Q4 1995 net loss was $0.57/shr including a loss of $0.53/shr on the disposal of discontinued operations and a loss of $0.02 a share on discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Year 1995 net loss was $0.60/shr including a loss of $0.53/shr on the disposal of discontinued operations and a loss of $0.15/shr on discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Year 1996 net loss was $0.08/shr including a gain of $0.09/shr on the disposal of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q4 1996 oper net and net figures are the same.</p>
